WEBVTT

00:33:27.451 --> 00:33:32.133
It's almost dangerous to say "thank you"
to those who are helping,

00:33:32.157 --> 00:33:38.427
because we're now in an environment
in which there are enemies.

00:33:38.451 --> 00:33:40.086
And who is evil?

00:33:40.110 --> 00:33:42.443
And do you fall into that category?

00:33:42.776 --> 00:33:45.126
And so, the history of these

00:33:45.150 --> 00:33:48.427
is there's demonizations
of different people.

00:33:49.275 --> 00:33:50.428
OK?

00:33:50.452 --> 00:33:52.441
Now you must see it around you.

00:33:52.465 --> 00:33:53.782
It exists.

00:33:53.806 --> 00:33:58.810
And so how we come out of this
will be how we behave with each other.

00:33:59.904 --> 00:34:01.055
CH: Yeah.